        // decided once, here, so swBindArgs pays one string comparison per call.
        // A VARIADIC parameter binds an array, not a value, so it adopts nothing.
        //
        // swAdoptNeeded, not swAdoptable: a STRUCTURAL annotation adopts too
        // (`[Double]`, `[String: Double]`, `(Double, Int)`, `Double?`,
        // `(Double) -> Double`), which is what the comment above the ParamType rule
        // always claimed and the code did not do (docs/todo.md 1.2). The compiler
        // half's twin is the same one-word change in its own makeParam.
